y reverted to \\\"10 items available\\\" (seeded items only), confirming the sold item no longer appears in browse results. Visiting the item's own product page (via View button) showed \\\"This item is no longer available\\\" message in place of any purchase action, and only \\\"Manage Your Listings\\\" (owner-only) button was shown - no Add to Cart control present, confirming purchase actions are blocked for sold items.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registered Tim Tester / tim.tester.qa@example.com / secret6 / Seattle, WA. Toast 'Account created successfully!' shown; header now shows 'Sell' button and 'Tim Tester' user menu instead of Log in/Sign up, confirming signed-in session.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Applied combined filters: Home Decor category -> 2 items; added Like New condition -> narrowed to 1 item (Vintage Brass Floor Lamp); added Upcycled-only -> still 1 matching item (consistent, correct). Changed sort to \\\"Price: Low to High\\\" while filtered. Clicked \\\"Clear all filters\\\": item count reverted to 10 and sort order was correctly ascending by price ($35, $45, $55, $65, $95, $125, $175, $180, $285, $320), confirming category+condition+upcycled filters combine correctly (AND logic) and sort persists/works correctly across the full unfiltered set.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typed \\\"DENIM\\\" (uppercase) into search box: results filtered to 1 item (\\\"Vintage Denim Jacket - Size M\\\"), confirming case-insensitive title match. Typed \\\"portland\\\" (lowercase, matches location field): filtered to 3 items all located in Portland, OR, confirming search also matches location. Cleared the search box: results count reverted to \\\"10 items available\\\" showing all original items.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Added \\\"Reclaimed Wood Bookshelf\\\" ($320) to cart from its product page. Cart page shows: photo, title (linked), location (Portland, OR), price ($320), and a Total of $320.00 matching the single item's price. \\\"1 item\\\" count shown in header.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicked \\\"Message Seller\\\" on a product page; a dialog \\\"Send a message to Marcus Chen\\\" opened with a textbox and a \\\"Send Message\\\" button that was disabled while the textbox was empty. Typed a non-empty message (\\\"Hi, is this jacket still available? I'd love to buy it.\\\"), which enabled the Send Message button. Clicking it produced a visible confirmation toast \\\"Message sent to seller!\\\" and the dialog closed. Also verified the cart's purchase-request flow: clicking \\\"Send Purchase Request\\\" produced toast \\\"Purchase requests sent to sellers!\\\" and cleared the cart.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Category browsing link does not apply the filter\", \"actual\": \"On /categories page, \\\"Furniture\\\" category card correctly displayed \\\"3 items\\\". Clicking it navigated to /?category=furniture, but the Browse page still displayed all \\\"10 items available\\\" (unfiltered) and the \\\"Furniture\\\" checkbox in the sidebar filter panel was NOT checked. The category browsing link/URL query param has no effect on the actual results shown - the count and item list did not match the selected category.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No seller-facing UI exists to view received purchase requests or buyer messages\", \"actual\": \"Logged in as buyer and sent a \\\"Message Seller\\\" text to Marcus Chen (seller of Vintage Denim Jacket, prod-2) and also sent a cart purchase request for Reclaimed Wood Bookshelf (prod-10). Then logged in as Marcus Chen (the seller who received the message) and checked all reachable seller-facing surfaces: header icons (only Sell button and Cart icon present, no messages/notifications icon), the \\\"Marcus Chen\\\" account dropdown menu (only \\\"My Profile\\\", \\\"My Listings\\\", \\\"Log out\\\"), the My Listings page (each listing card shows only View/Mark Sold/Delete buttons with no message/request indicator or count), and My Profile (route /profile returns a 404 \\\"Page not found\\\"). There is no inbox, messages, or purchase-requests view anywhere for the seller to see the buyer's message or the purchase request that were sent.\", \"evidence\": \"My Listings page (Marcus Chen) shows listing cards with buttons \\\"View / Mark Sold / Delete\\\" only, no message badge; /profile route renders 404 \\\"Oops! Page not found\\\"; account dropdown menu items limited to My Profile, My Listings, Log out.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Login with unregistered email nonexistent-user-xyz123@example.com shows toast 'Invalid credentials. Try: emma@example.com', stays on /login, no session created.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"CORRECTED after retesting without an intervening full page reload (which had previously wiped in-memory app state and invalidated the first attempt). With Tim Tester (tim.tester.qa@example.com) registered and then logged out via in-app menu, re-registering with case-variant email 'TIM.TESTER.QA@example.com' was rejected: toast 'An account with this email already exists', user stayed on /register with entered Full Name/Email/Password/Location values still shown, and no new session was created (original account not replaced).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Password is not verified on login for registered accounts\", \"actual\": \"Retested cleanly (no intervening reload): registered Tim Tester (tim.tester.