ted.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Logged out (in-app). Header no longer shows \\\"Sell\\\" button; instead shows \\\"Log in\\\"/\\\"Sign up\\\", and homepage CTA becomes \\\"Start Selling\\\" linking to /register - unauthenticated users cannot reach the create-listing form directly. Clicked \\\"Add to Cart\\\" on a product while logged out: redirected to /login with toast \\\"Please log in to add items to your cart\\\" - cart operation blocked with clear sign-in prompt. Clicked \\\"Message Seller\\\" while logged out: dialog opened but the submit button read \\\"Log in to message\\\" and remained disabled even after typing a non-empty message, blocking the purchase-request/message flow with a clear sign-in indication.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"CORRECTED after retesting without an intervening reload. Attempting to register the already-used email (case-variant) immediately shows a visible toast 'An account with this email already exists' and the registration form remains available with the previously entered values intact for correction.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Search results count and item list updated immediately after typing into the search box (no submit button or Enter key press required) for both \\\"DENIM\\\" and \\\"portland\\\" queries, and reverted immediately upon clearing.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Each filter checkbox click (category, condition, upcycled) and sort selection instantly updated the item count/list without any submit action. \\\"Clear all filters\\\" button instantly restored the full 10-item default list.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Immediately after clicking Add to Cart (no reload): a toast \\\"Added to cart!\\\" appeared and the header cart icon badge updated from no count to \\\"1\\\" instantly. Opening the cart page reflected the new line item and total without any page reload being required.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Checked multiple product detail pages. Each consistently shows: photo, title (heading), full description, price, category breadcrumb/badge, condition badge, location with distance, listing date (\\\"Listed YYYY-MM-DD\\\"), seller name+location. Upcycled items show an \\\"Upcycled\\\" badge overlay on the photo (e.g. prod-10 Reclaimed Wood Bookshelf); non-upcycled items omit it (e.g. prod-2 Vintage Denim Jacket), correctly reflecting upcycled status. Availability is conveyed via the action area: active items show \\\"Add to Cart\\\"/\\\"Message Seller\\\", while a sold item (tested earlier, prod-1787573081989) instead shows \\\"This item is no longer available\\\" in place of purchase actions - consistently indicating availability state.\"}]}"
